# Global Vibez DSG — Environment Template

Canonical app: `source/web-assets` (CRA + FastAPI + Mongo).

## Backend (`source/web-assets/backend/.env`)

```bash
MONGO_URL=mongodb://127.0.0.1:27017
DB_NAME=global_vibez
JWT_SECRET=change-me
DISABLE_BG_SCHEDULERS=1
CORS_ORIGINS=http://localhost:3000,https://www.globalvibezdsg.com,https://globalvibezdsg.com
FRONTEND_URL=https://www.globalvibezdsg.com
```

## Frontend (`source/web-assets/frontend/.env`)

```bash
REACT_APP_BACKEND_URL=http://localhost:8001
REACT_APP_FRONTEND_URL=http://localhost:3000
```

## Production (Vercel / Azure static build)

Must be present at **build** time (empty string is OK; missing key is not):

```bash
REACT_APP_BACKEND_URL=https://YOUR-LIVE-FASTAPI-HOST
REACT_APP_FRONTEND_URL=https://www.globalvibezdsg.com
```

Optional: Privy, Firebase, Mapbox, Phantom — see `source/web-assets/backend/ENV_VARIABLES.md`.
